invalid day of month: ask again: day of month does not exist
hour is out of range: ask again: hour has no such value
syntax error at byte 12: highlight byte 12
arithmetic overflow: cap the value
unknown time zone Mars/Base: offer a zone list instead of Mars/Base
malformed zone data: report corrupt data: zone data
unsupported locale verb %c: tell the user locale verb %c cannot be used
local time does not exist in the zone: ask for another time, that local time never happens
local time occurs twice in the zone: ask which of the two occurrences
offset does not match the zone: ask which of offset and zone to trust
